WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.230
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.360
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.110
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.940
Shining Finger

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.820
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.660
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:26.330
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:32.590
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.010
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:48.350
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.650
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.150
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.240
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.240
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.000
Bright you now

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:10.840
Shining Finger

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.500
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.050
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:24.680
Well, everybody...

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:27.270
Deep in the Guyana Highlands...

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:31.060
...Domon Kasshu is devoting
himself to his training.

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:33.550
Wouldn't you be astounded...

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:36.490
...to learn that the Dragon
Gundam and the Bolt Gundam...

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:37.140
Neo China Neo Russia
Dragon Gundam Bolt Gundam

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:39.860
...are about to engage
in a fierce battle?

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.320
What will be the outcome?

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:43.790
And now!

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:48.450
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:54.960
Fierce Battle!
Dragon Gundam vs. Bolt Gundam

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:05.470
The power circuit's been severed
in areas A to B and E to G...

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:08.070
...causing a leak in the energy
transmitted to the mode line.

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:10.850
It's not going to be
easy to fix this.

00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:14.920
But I have to do it.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.340
Especially since Domon's
training so hard.

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:49.770
Looks like he has a way to go.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:56.580
Domon Kasshu...

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:59.820
...until you're capable of
using that sword...

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:02.160
...you'll never be able to
control the Super Mode.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.330
Sai Saici! Wait!

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:08.410
We've only just started training!

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.520
Forget it!

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.250
Hey, Sis!

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.000
Good evening!

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:18.250
Idiot! What do you think you're doing?!

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:23.220
What is that kid doing out here,
anyway?

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:32.140
You peeked.

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:41.070
You haven't been
training enough, Domon.

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:46.320
All that effort to get here.

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:48.370
But it's no use if he acts like this.

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:52.040
Is a revival of the Shaolin Temple
only a dream?!

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:55.270
What is it with these guys?

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:02.630
They still want me to train?

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:04.880
I just can't keep up with those
worrying old men.

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:16.200
Must be seeing things.

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:25.760
Those are the Neo Russia guys.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:39.880
Naw, this won't do.

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:43.090
Their whole approach
to seasoning is wrong.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:00.770
Who's there?!

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:10.240
Isn't she overreacting a little?

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:18.830
Argo Gulskii!

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:23.840
Let go! Let me go!

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.050
Sai Saici.

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:26.630
What are you doing here?

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:33.640
I just lost my way. That's all!

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:36.270
Huh?

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:51.620
Guess I'll have to
force my way through!

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:58.960
Over here! Over here!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:04.550
Got him!

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:38.080
Hey...!

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:56.180
Argo, where's the intruder?!

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.610
Ouch!

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:12.530
Can't you be more gentle?

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:14.120
Don't complain.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:14.820
But...

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:17.290
How shameful.
You're a big boy, aren't you?

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:20.500
Was it Argo Gulskii of Neo Russia?

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:24.460
We didn't have a chance
to talk in Shinjuku...

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:26.960
...but I gather he is
quite formidable.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:32.430
Your fancy martial arts couldn't
stand up to his strength, huh?

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:34.510
Only because I let my guard down!

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:37.810
But it looked like he did quite
a number on you.

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:41.480
A child should behave like a child
and not wander off alone.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.520
Yeah?! Just watch me!

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:48.400
When he sees how serious I am...

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:51.150
...that hulk won't stand a chance!

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:52.240
Damn!

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:03.870
I know more than anyone the
importance of the Gundam Fight.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:08.710
But the threat posed by the
Devil Gundam is far more serious!

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:13.550
That's why I must keep tabs
on Domon Kasshu.

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:14.430
However...

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:19.510
...some say that the Shinjuku
incident was a mass hallucination.

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:21.590
"Mass hallucination"?

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:26.440
In any case, your duty is to see
that we win the Gundam Fight...

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:29.110
...and not to express opinions
on government policy.

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:33.150
You should focus on defeating
that powerful enemy...

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:34.720
...the Shining Gundam!

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:41.140
They don't understand anything!

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:46.580
The Dragon Gundam!

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:49.670
Argo Gulskii!

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.590
I challenge you to
a Gundam Fight match!

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:56.880
Come on!
Bring out your Bolt Gundam!

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:58.140
I refuse.

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:00.010
What'd you say?!

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:02.300
I will not fight someone
in your state.

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:03.850
Leave now.

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.100
W-wait a minute...

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:07.060
Hang on!

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:12.860
I get it! You're too scared
to mess with me!

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:16.030
Say something!

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:18.410
Coward! You big coward!

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:21.120
Come get me!

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.080
Sai Saici of Neo China!

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.590
Were you the intruder before?!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.010
Darn!

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:34.670
Fire warning shots!

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:42.800
Halt your fire!

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:45.580
Argo...

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:48.040
...why did you refuse to fight him?

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:50.690
Are you telling me
I should've accepted?

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:53.020
I'm the one who makes
those decisions!

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:56.300
You just follow orders!

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:59.320
This place is too noisy.

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:00.970
I want to be alone for a while.

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:02.620
Wait!

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:05.580
Don't forget!
You're still a prisoner!

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:08.120
If you don't follow orders...

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:10.080
...the bomb on your chest
will detonate!

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:12.790
You can't get away
no matter where you go.

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.590
The two of you can come out now!

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:24.510
I'm sorry for the intrusion.

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:28.770
Actually, we've come here because
we have a favor to ask of you.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:30.980
A favor?

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:36.610
Not yet...

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:37.990
Not yet! Not yet!

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:39.490
Not yet!

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:45.700
What have I been doing
that's not right?!

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:53.440
Argo...!

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:02.590
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:05.300
You want us to
accept your challenge?

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:07.470
We're well aware...

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:11.190
...that the side being challenged
has the right to accept or decline.

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:11.940
Nevertheless...

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:16.020
All we ask is that you do battle
against the Dragon Gundam.

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:18.610
They must have great confidence.

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:20.400
Or is there another reason?

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:30.650
Why did you reject
Sai Saici's challenge?

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.000
For a prisoner like you...

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.960
...battles are the only freedom
you're allowed.

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:40.760
I've never felt joy
while I was fighting.

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:44.970
Not since my days as a pirate.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:48.210
No. Fighting against you
was different.

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:53.230
That was a phenomenal fight.

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:57.260
I'd love to have another battle
like that.

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:01.440
Why not fight Sai Saici?

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:10.500
That's in the direction
of our camp!

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:17.000
Firefighting unit,
what's taking so long?!

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:20.630
That's the Dragon Gundam!

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:24.470
Can't be!

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:27.890
There's no way Sai Saici
would do such a lowly thing!

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:31.850
Argo Gulskii!

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:34.310
This disaster struck
when you took off!

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:36.230
This is an order!

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:38.650
Fight against the Dragon Gundam!

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:45.610
Good.

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:47.410
Though this wasn't planned...

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:49.370
...our prayers have been answered.

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:50.540
Yes.

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:52.620
Defeating the Gundam
of Neo China...

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:55.580
...means our nation won't be
able to ignore me so easily!

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:05.630
Why'd you come here, anyway?

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:08.100
I'm busy maintaining our Gundam.

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:10.470
Leave me alone, meanie.

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:17.350
The Bolt Gundam?

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:19.150
Finally feel like fighting, huh?

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:23.190
Why'd you do what you did?!

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:24.780
But what did I do?

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:28.240
I didn't want to fight you
in your present state.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:31.830
But if you want,
I'm giving it my all!

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.540
Well, the same thing goes for me!

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:36.460
Gundam Fight!

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:37.920
Ready!

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.330
Go!

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:43.800
It's begun!

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:45.170
But...!

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.400
How's that?
Too scared to speak?

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:08.110
Only amateurs jabber on
during a match.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:10.990
Who're you calling an amateur?!

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:29.430
You're not too shabby at this.

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:34.300
Guess there's no need
to pull my punches.

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:40.230
I'm glad there're Fighters around
other than Domon who are...

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:41.290
...this strong!

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:45.400
It's all going smoothly.
As we planned.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:47.780
As you planned?

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:48.990
That's right.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:51.990
Actually...

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:53.740
...ever since the battle
against the Devil Gundam...

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:55.490
...Sai Saici has lost the will to fight.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:57.080
Despite his training...

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:59.870
...his mind seems to
wander somewhere else.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.180
The Devil Gundam is the...

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:16.260
...first opponent that Sai Saici
felt he could not beat.

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:19.350
The shock from that might
have been considerable.

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:23.600
The best way for him
to regain his will...

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:26.070
...was to have him fight
a strong enemy.

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:29.150
Unfortunately, you happened
to be in training.

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:31.780
So you had Argo take on that role?

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.410
But Argo's really strong,
you know.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:34.990
What if Sai Saici loses?

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:37.410
Come to think of it...

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:39.470
...we didn't take that into account.

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:40.580
Zuisen!

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:41.580
Keiun!

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:43.540
We have a problem.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:48.250
As far as I can see,
they're pretty well matched.

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:49.670
You're wrong, Domon!

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:55.430
Open those eyes of yours,
and take a good look!

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:57.720
It's clear that Argo Gulskii
has the advantage!

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:04.270
What...?!

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:05.150
Is that...?!

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:09.230
The Bolt Gundam is keeping
his movements to a minimum.

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:13.200
The Dragon Gundam's movements
are considerably more.

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:15.910
Soon he will use up his energy.

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:18.620
He's right. If this keeps up...!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:29.560
I guess you're not just
some old man, after all.

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:31.090
Okay...

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:33.260
You're finished now!

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:36.720
Hoka-kyoten!

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:38.970
Goka! Shichi Reiki!

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:47.770
You expect this child's play
to work?!

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:49.910
You bet I do!

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:52.240
For the finish!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.360
Not so fast!

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:17.050
Off with your head!

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:19.970
I...

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:24.270
...I cannot afford to lose!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:46.480
You see, Domon?

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:49.710
Fighting at that level is possible
by focusing...

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.440
...all of your senses
toward the enemy.

00:17:52.650 --> 00:17:54.010
Yes.

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:55.970
Lose your fears and confusion...

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:58.380
...and put your soul
into your techniques!

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:02.350
Focus all my senses
toward the enemy...

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:13.650
I must...

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:15.660
Halt! That's enough!

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:17.400
Wh-what's going on?

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:18.450
Don't move!

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:20.950
We're taking you in
as key witnesses...

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:23.910
...regarding the attack
on our camp.

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.580
What do you mean?!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:29.460
This is a necessary measure
in case...

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:30.920
...Dragon Gundam wasn't the one.

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:32.880
Is that so?

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:35.380
- Then what's that?!
- What?

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:42.400
Looks like the true culprit
you're looking for.

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:45.640
Attack it now! Bolt Gundam!

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:46.600
Lmpossible!

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:49.140
They fought a tough battle
and have reached their limits!

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:52.110
Damn...

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:54.940
I-I'm out of energy.

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:00.360
Let's go, Domon!

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:01.660
R-right!

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:04.160
Rise!

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:07.430
Shining Gundam!

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:09.500
Wait, Domon!

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:11.290
What?

00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:12.880
What's this?

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:19.130
What's wrong?!

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:25.030
What's going on?

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:27.970
I have no control of my Gundam!

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:29.020
Domon!

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:30.310
I'm sorry!

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:32.310
I wasn't done with the maintenance!

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:35.940
I think the Mobile Trace System's
feedback level is set too high!

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:40.070
Domon!

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:50.160
Just stay where you are!

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:51.510
Don't move!

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:04.090
The last one!

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:08.560
No!

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:22.320
Don't show your fear, Domon!

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:23.320
That's right!

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:24.610
Focus all my senses!

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:29.180
Focus all my senses
toward the enemy!

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:38.680
Okay, here I go!

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:42.090
This hand of mine
shines and roars!

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:47.180
Its cry tells me to defeat you!

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:52.390
Ultimate!

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:57.020
Shining Finger!

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:05.110
Domon!

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:12.160
They were false Dragon Gundams
created by the Devil Gundam!

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:15.720
It has extended its territory
and come all this way.

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:25.460
Hey, Mister!

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:29.470
How come you didn't
want to fight me at first?

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:32.220
That moment...

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:34.860
...I realized you were
not at your best.

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:38.940
I would've fought you if
I knew you were at your best.

00:21:41.270 --> 00:21:42.340
See you again.

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:45.190
Yeah, right.

00:21:45.190 --> 00:21:46.620
See ya!

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:51.160
Domon.

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:54.620
Only strong opponents
bring out the best in a Fighter.

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:58.330
Unless you get on with it,
they'll be leaving you behind.

00:21:58.880 --> 00:22:02.050
If you don't want to fail,
you must strengthen yourself.

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:04.630
H-he's right.

00:22:04.630 --> 00:22:06.880
I've got to keep moving forward.

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:09.770
Until the day that
I can use this sword!

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:13.720
I'll do it!!

00:22:27.950 --> 00:22:32.580
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:36.950
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.250 --> 00:22:41.420
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:44.960
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.250 --> 00:22:52.140
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:52.640 --> 00:22:57.850
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:03.110
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:09.650
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:13.780
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:13.950 --> 00:23:19.790
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:36.060
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:38.890
George is haunted by illusions
of the Devil Gundam!

00:23:39.270 --> 00:23:41.100
His faithful butler, Raymond...

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:44.060
...tries everything to get
George back on his feet.

00:23:44.740 --> 00:23:46.070
However...

00:23:46.070 --> 00:23:47.900
...an outraged beast with a burning
desire for vengeance...

00:23:47.900 --> 00:23:50.360
...strikes its fangs at George's!

00:23:50.740 --> 00:23:52.950
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:54.120
George...

00:23:54.120 --> 00:23:56.240
...Beat the Nightmare!

00:23:54.200 --> 00:24:00.210
George, Beat the Nightmare!

00:23:56.240 --> 00:23:58.750
Ready! Go!
